  "aboutMd": "November in Delhi gives you three good weeks between the heat and the smog. The second edition takes them.\n\nOut along Kartavya Path, around India Gate, and back down the far carriageway. Air quality is published every morning of race week, and the race is called off rather than run through a bad number.",
  "rulesMd": "- Bibs are personal. Running on someone else's entry means both entries are cancelled.\n- Minimum ages are checked against your date of birth on race day, not on the day you register.\n- Headphones are allowed on the 5K only. The 10K and 21K share live traffic junctions.\n- Cut-off is 3 hours from your category's flag-off. Roads reopen on schedule.\n- Entries are not transferable between people or between distances.",
